{"seq":4,"slug":"explainable-ai","title":"可解释 AI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-ethics-privacy/responsible-ai/explainable-ai","wordCount":1252,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"可解释-ai\">可解释 AI</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可解释 AI（Explainable AI, XAI）是使 AI 系统的决策过程对人类可理解的技术和方法。随着深度学习模型在高风险场景（信贷审批、医疗诊断、刑事司法）中的广泛部署，模型的&quot;黑箱&quot;特性带来了严重的信任和合规问题。GDPR 第 22 条赋予数据主体&quot;不受仅基于自动化处理的决策约束&quot;的权利，并要求提供&quot;关于所涉及逻辑的有意义信息&quot;——这在法律层面确立了对模型可解释性的需求。可解释 AI 不仅是合规需求，更是构建用户信任、发现模型偏见和改进模型性能的关键技术。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[可解释 AI 方法] --&gt; B[事前可解释]&#10;    A --&gt; C[事后解释]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[线性模型]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[决策树]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[规则列表]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[GAM]&#10;    C --&gt; D[全局解释]&#10;    C --&gt; E[局部解释]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[特征重要性]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[部分依赖图 PDP]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[LIME]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[SHAP]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[反事实解释]\">graph TD\n    A[可解释 AI 方法] --&gt; B[事前可解释]\n    A --&gt; C[事后解释]\n    B --&gt; B1[线性模型]\n    B --&gt; B2[决策树]\n    B --&gt; B3[规则列表]\n    B --&gt; B4[GAM]\n    C --&gt; D[全局解释]\n    C --&gt; E[局部解释]\n    D --&gt; D1[特征重要性]\n    D --&gt; D2[部分依赖图 PDP]\n    E --&gt; E1[LIME]\n    E --&gt; E2[SHAP]\n    E --&gt; E3[反事实解释]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解释方法</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>模型无关性</th>\n<th>解释粒度</th>\n<th>计算成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>特征重要性</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>特征级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>模型审计/选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PDP/ICE</td>\n<td>全局/局部</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>特征级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>特征关系分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LIME</td>\n<td>局部</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>样本级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>个体决策解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SHAP</td>\n<td>全局+局部</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>特征级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>通用推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注意力可视化</td>\n<td>局部</td>\n<td>否(仅注意力模型)</td>\n<td>Token级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>NLP/CV 模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反事实解释</td>\n<td>局部</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>样本级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>可操作建议</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"shap-值解释框架\">SHAP 值解释框架</h2><p>SHAP（SHapley Additive exPlanations）基于博弈论中的 Shapley 值理论，为每个特征分配一个对预测结果的贡献值，具有数学上唯一满足效率性、对称性、虚拟性和可加性四个公理的加性特征归因方法。</p>\n<p><strong>Shapley 值的直觉</strong>是：对于一个预测结果，每个特征的贡献等于该特征在所有可能的特征子集中加入时产生的边际贡献的加权平均。想象一个团队项目的功劳分配——每个成员的贡献等于他/她在所有可能的团队组合中加入时带来的增量价值的平均。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from itertools import combinations&#10;&#10;def exact_shapley(model_predict, instance, feature_values, baseline):&#10;    n_features = len(instance)&#10;    shapley_values = np.zeros(n_features)&#10;&#10;    for i in range(n_features):&#10;        marginal_contributions = []&#10;        other_features = [j for j in range(n_features) if j != i]&#10;&#10;        for size in range(n_features):&#10;            for subset in combinations(other_features, size):&#10;                subset = set(subset)&#10;&#10;                with_i = baseline.copy()&#10;                for j in subset:&#10;                    with_i[j] = instance[j]&#10;                with_i[i] = instance[i]&#10;&#10;                without_i = baseline.copy()&#10;                for j in subset:&#10;                    without_i[j] = instance[j]&#10;&#10;                marginal = model_predict(with_i) - model_predict(without_i)&#10;&#10;                weight = (np.math.factorial(len(subset)) *&#10;                         np.math.factorial(n_features - len(subset) - 1) /&#10;                         np.math.factorial(n_features))&#10;                marginal_contributions.append(weight * marginal)&#10;&#10;        shapley_values[i] = sum(marginal_contributions)&#10;&#10;    return shapley_values&#10;&#10;def simple_model(x):&#10;    return 3 * x[0] + 2 * x[1] - x[2] + 5&#10;&#10;instance = np.array([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])&#10;baseline = np.array([0.0, 0.0, 0.0])&#10;sv = exact_shapley(simple_model, instance, instance, baseline)&#10;print(f&quot;Prediction: {simple_model(instance)}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;Baseline: {simple_model(baseline)}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;SHAP values: {sv}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;Sum of SHAP: {sum(sv):.1f} (should = {simple_model(instance) - simple_model(baseline):.1f})&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> itertools </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> combinations</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> exact_shapley</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(model_predict, instance, feature_values, baseline):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(instance)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shapley_values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.zeros(n_features)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark: